1
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:42,290
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:47,640
[Episode17: My Career Matters,
and So Do You]

3
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:50,850
[Dongmen clothing trade center, Shencheng]

4
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,720
This is the one
making second-skin lingerie?

5
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,280
Yeah.

6
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,200
Impressive!

7
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,280
They've got the nerve
to make such a bold move.

8
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,280
Quite ambitious.

9
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,800
Ambitious is putting it mildly.

10
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,000
If this is real,

11
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,320
who'd bother squeezing
into those old, rundown markets

12
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:02,580
and putting up with those local bullies?

13
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,000
Ms. Wan

14
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,800
raised the rent by 30% this year,

15
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:07,700
and she's hiked
the protection fees again.

16
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:09,300
My place may look busy,

17
00:01:09,930 --> 00:01:12,730
but it doesn't actually
make much money in the end.

18
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,400
Watch your mouth.

19
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,400
Don't talk nonsense.

20
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,720
What is your problem?

21
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,050
Are you out of your mind?

22
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,000
Keep it down.

23
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,860
Don't get yourself into trouble.

24
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,360
Mr. Chu, thank you

25
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:53,780
for printing the newspaper for Dongmen.

26
00:01:55,759 --> 00:01:57,490
What should we print next time?

27
00:01:59,479 --> 00:02:00,440
Let me think.

28
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,570
A grand opening announcement?

29
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,600
A sales leaderboard?

30
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:07,600
Or a wedding notice?

31
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:11,000
Next, we're printing

32
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:13,640
the very first map of Dongmen.

33
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:15,720
This blueprint will
determine the livelihoods

34
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,450
of tens of thousands of people.

35
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,560
As for the wedding notice,

36
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,640
that can wait until

37
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:24,720
the first batch of Dongmen merchants
start making money,

38
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:27,280
and Fashion Flower

39
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:29,200
opens a branch in Harboria.

40
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,920
Then we'll talk about it.

41
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,400
Are you mad?

42
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,460
You little grouch.

43
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,320
Fine.

44
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:44,740
I'll have the printing plant
ready anytime.

45
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:47,500
Thank you, Mr. Chu.

46
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,440
I'll land this deal

47
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,640
and show you who's boss.

48
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,240
No one gets to take

49
00:03:06,550 --> 00:03:07,670
what's mine.

50
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,140
The ad is in today's paper.

51
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,120
By all rights,

52
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:24,920
even if people
aren't lining up at the door,

53
00:03:25,079 --> 00:03:27,940
we should at least be getting
some inquiries by now.

54
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,940
Someone must be trying to keep them away.

55
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,160
Ms. Xie,

56
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,600
I called a few business owners who'd shown

57
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:39,260
particular interest before.

58
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:42,320
Some were hesitant,
saying they'd think about it,

59
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,240
while others

60
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,960
wouldn't even answer their phones.

61
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,120
This is strange.

62
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,960
In Shencheng,

63
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,520
news travels fast,

64
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:54,050
so something should've
gotten around by now.

65
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,380
Something's definitely off.

66
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,200
Boss, I...

67
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:03,080
I've actually heard a few things lately.

68
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,400
Before I started working for you,

69
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,480
I used to run with the street crowd,

70
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,720
so I know a few people

71
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:10,920
in the underworld.

72
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,400
There are some nasty rumors going around

73
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:14,000
about Dongmen trade center.

74
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,640
There are mainly 2 stories.

75
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:16,279
First,

76
00:04:16,279 --> 00:04:18,640
they say construction hasn't even started,

77
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:20,160
and all those renderings are fake.

78
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,200
It's all a scam.

79
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:23,000
It's just to lure merchants
in with false promises

80
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:25,400
and swindle them out of
their commissions and deposits.

81
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,280
Second,

82
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,740
they say powerful people
have had their eyes

83
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:29,200
on this project for a long time.

84
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,720
Ms. Xie has offended someone,

85
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,280
and an investigation
could come down at any moment.

86
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,480
Anyone who gets involved now

87
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,280
could lose everything.

88
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,640
Where did you hear all this?

89
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:39,120
A few drunk thugs let it slip.

90
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:41,520
It seems

91
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,850
the rumors came from Ms. Wan's people.

92
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:51,040
Biao,

93
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,040
thank you.

94
00:04:58,920 --> 00:04:59,640
Biao,

95
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:04,080
your past has nothing
to do with who you are now.

96
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,760
Everyone has a past.

97
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,240
Thank you.

98
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:15,880
I need to go see this Ms. Wan.

99
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,840
But

100
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:21,320
if she's really behind this,

101
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:22,960
chances are

102
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:24,840
she won't even see me.

103
00:05:27,020 --> 00:05:28,060
I was thinking,

104
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,840
everyone has their own habits

105
00:05:35,159 --> 00:05:36,159
and preferences.

106
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,040
Ma'am,

107
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:43,620
those two are still waiting
across from the nightclub.

108
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:46,690
At least they have some sincerity.

109
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,520
Ma'am,

110
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,650
please don't go soft on her.

111
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:57,720
Xie Nanfeng

112
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:01,040
is notorious for her dirty tricks.

113
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:08,240
She claims she wants to work with you,

114
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,880
but behind your back,

115
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,700
she's really after
your business in the old town.

116
00:06:12,700 --> 00:06:14,000
Once she gets established,

117
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,640
where will that leave us?

118
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:23,040
And I've also heard

119
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,640
that in private,

120
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:28,040
she mocks you as an outdated old-timer.

121
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:30,840
She says all you know
is collecting protection money,

122
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:33,560
and you have no idea
what real business is.

123
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:36,840
She started that Dongmen project
to replace you

124
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:39,970
and make sure you never
collect another dime.

125
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:44,120
Come.

126
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,460
Tell them to get lost. Now.

127
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,480
If they show up again,

128
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:50,520
I won't be so nice.

129
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:03,080
We've waited all these days and
still haven't been able to meet with her.

130
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,840
Maybe my judgment was wrong.

131
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,250
Let's wait a little longer.

132
00:07:08,150 --> 00:07:10,020
Habits are called habits

133
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,480
because they're hard to change.

134
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,480
Ms. Wan still refuses to see us.

135
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,960
And I've noticed

136
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:22,600
Chang Yongbin has been
by her side constantly lately.

137
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:25,840
Got it.

138
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,200
Then someone

139
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:33,159
must be whispering in her ear,

140
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:35,750
making her afraid to negotiate

141
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,260
and unwilling to even try.

142
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,280
Exactly.

143
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,790
Taking away her livelihood

144
00:07:41,790 --> 00:07:43,590
hurts more than taking her life.

145
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,280
If that's the case,

146
00:07:49,980 --> 00:07:53,500
I'll offer her
an even bigger way to make money.

147
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,159
Then let Biao go

148
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,360
and tell her what we're offering.

149
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:59,440
Anyone with sense

150
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:02,260
will understand what that means.

151
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,240
All right, then.

152
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,040
Tell me.

153
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,680
What message did Xie Nanfeng send?

154
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,770
Miss Xie wants to work with you.

155
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,240
First,

156
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:24,440
Dongmen's security and logistics contracts

157
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,780
will be offered to your people first.

158
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:30,560
Second,

159
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:32,179
part of the market's

160
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,570
advertising budget

161
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,929
will be set aside for you to manage.

162
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:38,840
Anything else?

163
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:39,919
Third,

164
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,520
if you're willing,

165
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:42,600
Miss Xie

166
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:45,330
is prepared to offer
10% of the prime retail units

167
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:47,520
for your girls to run.

168
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:51,960
Ma'am,

169
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,680
this is a honey trap!

170
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:54,840
That's enough.

171
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,240
She's not...

172
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,960
Tell Xie Nanfeng

173
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,440
I'll see her tomorrow
at 3 in the afternoon,

174
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,100
upstairs on the second floor.

175
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,840
I want to see

176
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,640
what she's really up to.

177
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,960
Director Chang,

178
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:33,640
fancy running into you again!

179
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:37,080
Weren't you a factory director?

180
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:41,120
When did you start playing right-hand man?

181
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,720
Whoever stands against Ms. Wan

182
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,040
stands against me.

183
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,160
Xie Nanfeng,

184
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,760
don't get ahead of yourself.

185
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:50,640
You must be Ms. Wan.

186
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:53,120
I've heard so much about you.

187
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:54,640
I'm here today

188
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,040
with a sincere offer

189
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:59,040
to grow the business together.
